@host = http://localhost:5027

### Successful Basic login: Burns01 / Password1
GET {{host}}/api/auth/login
Authorization: Basic QnVybnMwMTpQYXNzd29yZDE=

### Missing credentials: 401
GET {{host}}/api/auth/login

### Retrieve all stored items (no authentication required)
GET {{host}}/api/items

### Add an item (repeat the same ID to receive 409 Conflict)
POST {{host}}/api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "itemId": "1001",
  "itemName": "Notebook",
  "itemDescription": "Blue spiral notebook"
}
